  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n__\n \n• Consider A as '+'\n \n• Consider B as '-'\n \n• Consider C as '÷'\n\nGiven,\n\n \n• 15 A 8 B 9 C 3 = 20\n\n⇒ 15 + 8 - **9 ÷ 3**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**15 + 8**__ - 3 = 20\n\n⇒ __**23 - 3**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 18 A 20 B 15 C 5 = 35\n\n⇒ 18 + 20 - **15 ÷ 5**__ = 35\n\n⇒ __**18 + 20**__ - 3 = 35\n\n⇒ __**38 - 3**__ = 35\n\n⇒ 35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 8 A 6 B 4 C 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 8 + 6 - **4 ÷ 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**8 + 6**__ - 2 = ?\n\n⇒ __**14 - 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **12 = ?**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"12\".",
